t":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Zu vermieten ist ein freistehendes Ferienhaus (Hinterhaus) mit separatem Eingang, umgeben von Grünflächen und eigenem Garten. \nDie Aufteilung: Erdgeschoss Wohn- und Esszimmer Zimmer mit Zugang zum Garten Küche Bad mit Dusche und WC separates Gäste-WC Obergeschoss Schlafzimmer 1 Schlafzimmer 2, alternativ als Büro nutzbar Das Haus ist vollständig möbliert und mit allen notwendigen Geräten ausgestattet – Sie können direkt einziehen. Die Lage ist sehr zentral: Der Bahnhof ist gut angebunden, Apotheke, Bäcker, Metzger und weitere Geschäfte des täglichen Bedarfs sind fußläufig erreichbar. Da die Bedürfnisse von Mieter zu Mieter unterschiedlich sind, lässt sich die Nutzung des zweiten Schlafzimmers – etwa als Arbeitszimmer – gern im Vorfeld individuell absprechen. Sprechen Sie mich einfach an. Der Vermieter spricht Deutsch und Englisch. \n\nEnglish: Available for rent is a detached guest house at the rear of the property, with its own private entrance, surrounded by green space and a garden. \nLayout: Ground floor Living and dining room Room with direct garden access Kitchen Bathroom with shower and toilet Separate guest toilet Upper floor Bedroom 1 Bedroom 2, which can also be used as an office The house is fully furnished and equipped with everything you need, so you can move straight in. The location is very central: there is a good connection to the train station, and a pharmacy, bakery, butcher and other everyday shops are all within walking distance. As every tenant has different needs, the use of the second bedroom – as a home office, for example – can be arranged individually in advance. Just get in touch. The landlord speaks German and English.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"working professionals only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"108"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":210000,"deposit":210000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"2100.00","deposit":"2100.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-10-01"}],"updated":"2026-09-12T10:11:16Z","__utId__":"ut1739403"}]